  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "むれの　なかで　いちばん　おおきな\nほのおの　たてがみを　もつ　オスが\nリーダーとして　なかまを　ひきいる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "무리 중에서 가장 커다란\n불꽃 갈기를 지닌 수컷이\n리더로서 동료들을 이끈다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le mâle qui possède la crinière de feu la plus\nimposante devient le chef de la horde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Das Männchen mit der prächtigsten Feuermähne\nführt das Rudel an.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El macho con la melena de fuego más grande de toda\nla manada es el líder de sus compañeros.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Di solito, il maschio con la criniera fiammeggiante\npiù ampia guida i compagni del gruppo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The male with the largest mane of fire\nis the leader of the pride.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "群れの　中で　一番　大きな　炎の\nたてがみを　持つ　オスが\nリーダーとして　仲間を　率いる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El macho con la melena de fuego más grande de toda\nla manada es el líder de sus compañeros.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "せっし６０００どの　いきを　はきだし\nはげしく　あいてを　いかくする。\nメスが　むれの　こどもを　まもる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "섭씨 6000도의 숨을 내뿜어\n격렬하게 상대를 위협한다.\n암컷이 무리의 새끼를 지킨다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son souffle peut atteindre les 6 000 °C et il s’en sert\npour intimider l’ennemi. Dans la horde, les femelles\nprotègent les petits.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sie bedrohen ihre Gegner, indem sie 6 000 °C heiße\nAtemluft ausstoßen. Die Weibchen beschützen die\nJungen des Rudels.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Intimida con ferocidad al enemigo exhalando su aliento\nabrasador a 6000 °C de temperatura. Las hembras\nprotegen a los cachorros de la manada.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Minaccia furiosamente i nemici soffiando aria a una\ntemperatura che raggiunge i 6000 °C. Le femmine\nproteggono i piccoli del gruppo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "With fiery breath of more than 10,000 degrees\nFahrenheit, they viciously threaten any challenger.\nThe females protect the pride’s cubs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "摂氏６０００度の　息を　吐き出し\n激しく　相手を　威嚇する。\nメスが　群れの　子供を　守る。",
