    {
      "flavor_text": "オスは　ふだん　だらだら　しているが\nきょうてきが　おそってくると　わがみを\nかえりみず　なかまを　まもるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "수컷은 평소에 빈둥거리지만,\n강적이 덤벼들면 자신을\n돌보지 않고 동료를 지킨다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雄性平常十分懶散，\n但當有強敵來襲的時候，\n會奮不顧身地保護夥伴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le mâle a tendance à se prélasser à longueur\nde journée. Si un ennemi surgit, en revanche,\nil défend ses congénères au péril de sa vie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Männliche Exemplare faulenzen die meiste Zeit.\nWird ihr Rudel von starken Gegnern angegriffen,\nverteidigen sie dieses jedoch mit ihrem Leben.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Por lo general, el macho suele ser un holgazán,\npero si aparece un enemigo poderoso, no duda\nen plantarle cara para proteger a los suyos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Di solito il maschio passa le giornate nell’ozio,\nma se compare un nemico temibile è pronto a\nrischiare la vita per proteggere i compagni.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The males are usually lazy, but when attacked\nby a strong foe, a male will protect its friends\nwith no regard for its own safety.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "オスは　普段　だらだら　しているが\n強敵が　襲ってくると　わが身を\nかえりみず　仲間を　守るぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
